L neyvia.agent-guide v1 -- Agent guide: chats, apps, windows and every exact action
-- @record {"chapter":"agent-guide","data":"The exact contract directory includes every registered native action. Runtime, provider, desktop and MCP-scope readiness must still be observed; no listed action claims a completed journey.","key":"0","section":"frontier"}
F The exact contract directory includes every registered native action. Runtime, provider, desktop and MCP-scope readiness must still be observed; no listed action claims a completed journey.
-- @record {"chapter":"agent-guide","data":"Begin with a specific goal. Read this guide, then load only the owning manual chapter. Use CL help at L1, run named procedures, keep refs/stamps host managed, and finish with a fresh observer G.","key":"0","section":"guidance"}
M neyvia "Begin with a specific goal. Read this guide, then load only the owning manual chapter. Use CL help at L1, run named procedures, keep refs/stamps host managed, and finish with a fresh observer G." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"agent-guide","data":"Chats: session.new starts a CLI or native chat; session rename/pin/move/archive change the same user-visible state. Read agents and runtime-provider for provider turns, limits and recovery.","key":"1","section":"guidance"}
M neyvia "Chats: session.new starts a CLI or native chat; session rename/pin/move/archive change the same user-visible state. Read agents and runtime-provider for provider turns, limits and recovery." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"agent-guide","data":"Apps: app.open opens a real app or pane; read its app manual. Window ids come from view.state. view.place uses main (beside chat), side (left/right), full, bubble or close without remounting.","key":"2","section":"guidance"}
M neyvia "Apps: app.open opens a real app or pane; read its app manual. Window ids come from view.state. view.place uses main (beside chat), side (left/right), full, bubble or close without remounting." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"agent-guide","data":"Browser: browser opens, observes and acts on owned tabs. CAPTCHA/bot checks stop automation for the owner; never solve or bypass. Owner resumes after a fresh page check.","key":"3","section":"guidance"}
M neyvia "Browser: browser opens, observes and acts on owned tabs. CAPTCHA/bot checks stop automation for the owner; never solve or bypass. Owner resumes after a fresh page check." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"agent-guide","data":"Computer use and agent view: computer-use grants scoped native control on the agent desktop; agent-view observes, steers and replays recorded work. Owner consent remains required.","key":"4","section":"guidance"}
M neyvia "Computer use and agent view: computer-use grants scoped native control on the agent desktop; agent-view observes, steers and replays recorded work. Owner consent remains required." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"agent-guide","data":"LAYA: efficiency.laya_verify and cua.verify inspect evidence with the local verifier. Its answer is advisory; an unavailable model never becomes a made-up approval.","key":"5","section":"guidance"}
M neyvia "LAYA: efficiency.laya_verify and cua.verify inspect evidence with the local verifier. Its answer is advisory; an unavailable model never becomes a made-up approval." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"agent-guide","data":"Images: image-studio covers provider generation with explicit requests, local pixel edits, protected regions and exports. Inspect the live preview and generation receipt; provider availability is separate.","key":"6","section":"guidance"}
M neyvia "Images: image-studio covers provider generation with explicit requests, local pixel edits, protected regions and exports. Inspect the live preview and generation receipt; provider availability is separate." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"agent-guide","data":"App Factory: app-sdk creates/builds/inspects applications and frames; preview observes running apps. Native toolchains and permission checks apply.","key":"7","section":"guidance"}
M neyvia "App Factory: app-sdk creates/builds/inspects applications and frames; preview observes running apps. Native toolchains and permission checks apply." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"agent-guide","data":"3D Studio and connectors: gamedev and game-dev expose editor sessions, actual bridge actions and asset validation. Installed Unity/Roblox/Godot/Blender connectors must report availability before use.","key":"8","section":"guidance"}
M neyvia "3D Studio and connectors: gamedev and game-dev expose editor sessions, actual bridge actions and asset validation. Installed Unity/Roblox/Godot/Blender connectors must report availability before use." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"agent-guide","data":"Dictation: dictation covers status, local streaming transcription and named text processing. It uses the shared engine and reports fallback/availability honestly.","key":"9","section":"guidance"}
M neyvia "Dictation: dictation covers status, local streaming transcription and named text processing. It uses the shared engine and reports fallback/availability honestly." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"agent-guide","data":"Files, notes and PDF: files uses scoped paths, recoverable trash and undo; notes reads/writes the same notes folder; pdf opens/searches/annotates and extracts actual document text.","key":"10","section":"guidance"}
M neyvia "Files, notes and PDF: files uses scoped paths, recoverable trash and undo; notes reads/writes the same notes folder; pdf opens/searches/annotates and extracts actual document text." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"agent-guide","data":"Terminal and research: workspace covers bounded reads/writes and permitted terminal execution. research uses provider-backed cited answers and receipts. External actions never gain authority from this manual.","key":"11","section":"guidance"}
M neyvia "Terminal and research: workspace covers bounded reads/writes and permitted terminal execution. research uses provider-backed cited answers and receipts. External actions never gain authority from this manual." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"agent-guide","data":"Look and placement are reversible user choices. Keep chat drafts, source files and existing app instances while changing the view.","key":"12","section":"guidance"}
