-- @record {"chapter":"time","data":{"constraints":"Timer is elapsed time, not CPU/provider cost. Stop only measurement; it does not cancel work. A stopped ID cannot be reused for a new timing intent.","options":["lap-stop","keep-running"],"question":"Record this completed checkpoint and stop measurement?"},"key":"checkpoint","section":"judge"}
J checkpoint lap-stop|keep-running:"Record this completed checkpoint and stop measurement?" -- Timer is elapsed time, not CPU/provider cost. Stop only measurement; it does not cancel work. A stopped ID cannot be reused for a new timing intent.
V J checkpoint -> human:operator why:"explicit choice required"
-- @record {"chapter":"time","data":{"failure":"Timer ID/lapId reused with different intent","recovery":"Use new ID for new measurement; exact retries replay retained values"},"key":"0","section":"pitfalls"}
X Timer ID/lapId reused with different intent -> Use new ID for new measurement; exact retries replay retained values
-- @record {"chapter":"time","data":{"failure":"Timer spans backend restart","recovery":"Report clockBasis=wall_clock_recovered_estimate and clockAnomaly; do not call it monotonic precision"},"key":"1","section":"pitfalls"}
X Timer spans backend restart -> Report clockBasis=wall_clock_recovered_estimate and clockAnomaly; do not call it monotonic precision
-- @record {"chapter":"time","data":{"failure":"Advisory target exceeded","recovery":"Continue required work or report real blocker; timer does not stop it"},"key":"2","section":"pitfalls"}
X Advisory target exceeded -> Continue required work or report real blocker; timer does not stop it
-- @record {"chapter":"time","data":{"failure":"A lap is attempted on stopped timer or beyond 1000 laps","recovery":"Start a distinct timer for next measurement; retain old evidence"},"key":"3","section":"pitfalls"}
X A lap is attempted on stopped timer or beyond 1000 laps -> Start a distinct timer for next measurement; retain old evidence
